{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wanglou-e-3e9e52d5beee6fc1a189","title":"皓答诏慰留：以卿研精坟典博览多闻，当飞翰骋藻以越扬班张蔡之畴，宜勉修所职勿复纷纷（诏文完整保留）","accounts":[{"id":"wanglou-a-3e9e52d5beee6fc1a189","label":"正文","text":"皓答诏慰留：以卿研精坟典博览多闻，当飞翰骋藻以越扬班张蔡之畴，宜勉修所职勿复纷纷（诏文完整保留）","evidence":["wanglou-q-e3415cccc9b6c09825ae"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0162","role":"答诏","evidence":["wanglou-q-e3415cccc9b6c09825ae"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0085","role":"被勉留","evidence":["wanglou-q-e3415cccc9b6c09825ae"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wanglou-q-e3415cccc9b6c09825ae"]},"ordering_evidence":"wanglou-q-e3415cccc9b6c09825ae","order":11139}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0085","name":"华覈","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0162","name":"孙皓","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wanglou-q-e3415cccc9b6c09825ae","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-248830c8e4f9c81744ba","layer":"original","quote":"后迁东观令，领右国史。覈上疏辞让。皓答曰：“得表，以‘东观儒林之府，常讲校文艺〖1〗，处定疑难〖2〗；汉时皆名学硕儒乃任其职，乞更选英贤’，闻之〖3〗。以卿研精坟典，博览多闻，可谓‘悦礼乐、敦诗书’者也〖4〗。当飞翰骋藻〖5〗，光赞时事；以越扬、班、张、蔡之畴〖6〗。怪乃谦光〖7〗，厚自菲薄。宜勉修所职，以迈先贤：勿复纷纷〖8〗！”","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":428,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":167}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
